    "positive_oracle": "Every iteration must print all nine exact consumer observations, including 256/revision1, overflow refusal, exact duplicate, source provenance, recovered native task, attempt2/stale-ACK refusal, verified amount1, state257/revision2, and one admitted saga action. Missing/reordered/repeated phase markers fail the harness.",
